csas-authorize (0.5.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Token actions in token.php and welcomeback.php are protected by CSRF token
  * welcomeback.php lists older tokens with Remove buttons and a bulk
    "remove all unusable tokens" action (token.php?action=purge)
  * Czech translation of new messages
  * Test stage installs the Zabbix repository

 -- Vítězslav Vitex Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:38:07 +0200

csas-authorize (0.4.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * New package csas-authorize-zabbix: Zabbix agent2 monitoring of token
    expiration (LLD discovery, refresh token days left, template included)
  * token.php: missing refresh token no longer ends with HTTP 500, user is
    redirected to reauthorization
  * welcomeback.php: main menu and buttons back to the token and application
  * Fixed refresh token expiry calculation and expiring tokens notification
  * csas-authorize.service restarts on failure and waits for the database
  * Static debian autoloader only, composer removed from Build-Depends

 -- Vítězslav Vitex Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:03:45 +0200

csas-authorize (0.3.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Unified csas-access-token tool with import functionality
  * Added Developer Portal import/export capabilities
  * Enhanced OAuth2 error handling for expired refresh tokens
  * Comprehensive test suite implementation
  * Bidirectional data flow between CSAS Authorize and Developer Portal
  * Improved command-line interface and documentation

 -- Vítězslav Vitex Dvořák <info@vitexsoftware.cz>  Sun, 29 Sep 2024 12:00:00 +0200

